---

THE FONTS IN `fonts/` AND `tools/font-lab/built-fonts/` ARE NOT COVERED BY THE
MIT LICENSE ABOVE.

Each is a modified cut — re-metricated, sometimes case-remapped, and renamed —
of a family licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 or the Apache License
2.0. The original copyright, designer, vendor and license records are preserved
inside every font file. The full license text for each source family is in
`fonts/licenses/`, and `fonts/catalog.json` maps every shipped family to its
source family and license.

Redistributing these fonts means shipping those license files with them.
